  10++718E              P126_CATALOG_VISIBLE_ROWS EQU 9
  11++718E              P126_CATALOG_FIRST_ROW    EQU 2
  12++718E
  13++718E              ; Called after ATM video, RTC and console initialization.
  14++718E              ; Disk I/O has already been completed during the legacy TR-DOS boot phase.
  15++718E              p126_catalog_initialize:
